<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName},</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Congratulations on your admission to Arizona State University! You can view ASU's <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ftransfer.asu.edu%2Fsteps&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNH1fKbNVX_VFBPgWk-4kiqnLh5obQ">steps to enroll</a> for more information about your next steps.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">All new students must <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Feoss.asu.edu%2Fhealth%2Fservices%2Fimmunization&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNFnpS7Vr6rn9mBsmMAB1KvhtnwoEw">submit their MMR immunization records</a> and schedule an advising appointment before they register for classes. Your MMR immunization records should be sent to ASU Health Services; the fax number is 480-965-8914. Your academic advisor's information is located on your <a href="http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fmy.asu.edu&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEgLI1T20MQ7HMdoTLQy6mthStfLw">My ASU</a> page. Please make sure to schedule an advising appointment so your academic advisor can help you in the registration process.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">View our <a href="http://www.google.com/url?q=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.asu.edu%2Fclasses&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEzeYac4fIkGv1q-a_tFO7_8ihXYA">course catalog</a> online. Visit the <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fstudents.asu.edu%2Facademic-calendar&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNGhcKDOlmiSx2V0pNY6xFl7OQALxg">academic calendar</a> for important dates. If you are no longer interested in attending ASU, please officially <a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fstudents.asu.edu%2Fcanceladmissions&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AFQjCNEbHrh682AB3ZVTLUBL-6cjxIeXHw">decline your admission</a>.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Let me know if you have any questions.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Admission Services</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>